			</h1><div class="c-page-header__post-title"><p class="c-page-header__subheading">by Stuart Slade</p></div><div class="c-page-header__meta"><span class="c-page-header__datetime "><time datetime="2026-12-05T19:30:00+00:00" itemprop="startDate">Sat 5 Dec 2026</time>  &ndash;			<time datetime="2027-02-06T19:30:00+00:00"itemprop="endDate">Sat 6 Feb 2027</time></span>
				
