							</button></li></ul></div></template></v-tab-nav><section class="o-tab h-theme--tint2" id="content-overview"><h2 class="h-accessibility">About The King&#039;s Ransom</h2><div class="o-panel o-grid h-theme--tint2"><dl class="c-meta o-grid__item"></dl></div><div class="o-panel o-grid h-theme--tint2"><div  id="block-133091" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-1" data-block='[]'><blockquote><p><i>Stealin' dead folk's the American Dream?</i></p><p><i>Well, it’s always been an incredibly elastic concept - so yes.</i><br /> </p></blockquote><p>The plan is simple:<br />Kidnap Elvis Presley's corpse.<br />Stash him in a chest freezer.<br />Collect the million-dollar ransom.<br /><br />Memphis, 1977. When an enigmatic criminal mastermind offers small-time crook Vince Black the opportunity of a lifetime, Vince assembles a crack team of misfits and dropouts to attempt the heist of the century: swiping the earthly remains of The King of Rock and Roll.<br /><br />Inspired by one of the strangest crime stories in American history, <i><strong>The King's Ransom</strong></i>, a new play by <strong>Stuart Slade</strong>, is a Southern-fried dark comedy about grief, redemption and spectacularly bad decisions. <strong>Matthew Dunster</strong> directs <strong>Charlie Cox</strong>, <strong>Tom Fletcher,</strong> <strong>Matthew Flynn</strong>, <strong>Blake Harrison</strong>, <strong>Leo Patrick</strong>, <strong>Jenny Rainsford</strong>, <strong>Christopher Short</strong>, <strong>Cherrelle Skeete</strong> and <strong>Ronnie Yorke</strong> in this outrageous, heartfelt heist caper about the little guys taking one last shot at the American Dream.</p></div><div  id="block-50313" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-1" data-block='[]'><p><i>With special thanks to our Season Supporter, Charles Holloway OBE </i></p></div><v-custom-css styles=""></v-custom-css><div  id="block-168309" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-3" data-block='["reusableContent"]'><p><i>We would also like to thank our Production Supporters, Anne Wade &amp; Gil Hagan</i></p></div><div  id="block-133103" class="o-block o-cast-and-creatives o-grid__item o-grid__item--full o-block--row-4" data-block='["text"]'><div class="o-panel o-grid"><ul class="o-profile-grid o-grid__item"><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/charlie-cox"><div class="o-image c-profile__image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/The-Kings-Ransom/Headshots/Charlie-Cox-Photo-by-Brian-Bowen-Smith.jpeg?w=375&amp;h=375&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.4369&amp;fp-y=0.1238&amp;dm=1790851113&amp;s=24c4efbb6ed94fe79313d75ce3158f34" width="375" height="375" alt="" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 43.69% 12.38%;"></div><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Charlie Cox</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Vince</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/tom-fletcher"><div class="o-image c-profile__image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/The-Kings-Ransom/Headshots/Tom-Fletcher.jpeg?w=375&amp;h=375&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.4761&amp;fp-y=0.2341&amp;dm=1790851630&amp;s=816c45359bb5ea8233286fb310d92641" width="375" height="375" alt="" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 47.61% 23.41%;"></div><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Tom Fletcher</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Charlie</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/matthew-flynn">