			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-3" data-block='["table"]'><h4>Previews (first four performances)</h4></div><div  id="block-133112" class="o-block o-table o-grid__item o-block--row-4 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	" data-block='["text"]'><table><thead><tr><th class="text-left" width="20">Price A</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Price B</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Price C</th><th class="text-left" width="20">35 and under</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Standing</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-label="Price A"
								class="text-left">£71</td><td data-label="Price B"
								class="text-left">£54</td><td data-label="Price C"
								class="text-left">£25</td><td data-label="35 and under"
								class="text-left">£20</td><td data-label="Standing"
								class="text-left">£15</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div  id="block-177850" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-5" data-block='["table"]'><p>Every booking made online, via telephone or in person will be subject to a £1.75 transaction fee<br />All exchanges and ticket resales are subject to a £2 per ticket admin fee.<br />Members at the Friends level, and above, do not pay transaction or admin fees.</p></div><v-custom-css styles=""></v-custom-css><div  id="block-133138" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-3" data-block='["reusableContent"]'><h3>Access Performances</h3><p>Captioned performance<br />Monday 25 January 7:30pm<br /><br />Audio described performance<br />Saturday 30 January 2:30pm</p><p>Find out more about Access at the Donmar <a href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/your-visit/access">here</a></p></div><div  id="block-133139" class="o-block o-accordion o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-4" data-block='["text"]'><section class="o-accordion"><h3 class="o-accordion__title">Additional information</h3><details-utils animate><details class="o-accordion__item"><summary class="o-accordion__subtitle"><span class="o-accordion__subtitle-text">Last minute tickets</span></summary><div class="o-accordion__text o-text"><p>With Donmar Daily there are tickets available for our productions every day online. </p><p>A small allocation of tickets will be released every morning, Monday – Saturday, at 10am for performances seven days later. These are only available online, subject to availability and may not be available for some performances.</p><p>Any returned tickets are made available online to purchase. You can also ask in person at the Box Office. </p></div></details></details-utils><details-utils animate><details class="o-accordion__item"><summary class="o-accordion__subtitle"><span class="o-accordion__subtitle-text">Performance times</span></summary><div class="o-accordion__text o-text"><p>Evenings Mon – Sat 7.30pm<br />Thursday &amp; Saturday matinees 2.30pm (from 17 December)</p></div></details></details-utils><details-utils animate><details class="o-accordion__item"><summary class="o-accordion__subtitle"><span class="o-accordion__subtitle-text">Content warnings</span></summary><div class="o-accordion__text o-text"><p>To be confirmed</p></div></details></details-utils></section></div></div></div></section><section class="o-tab" id="content-dates-and-times"><instance-list default-tab="standard" :access-tabs-enabled="1" :items="8" :element-query="'.c-instance-list__item'"><template v-slot:default="{selectedTab}"><ul class="o-grid__item h-colstart--1 h-colend--10 h-tablet-colend--13 c-instance-list"><li class="o-list__item c-instance-list__item" data-date="2026-12-05"><event-manager
